      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i used to believe in is just... gone. i spent my whole life building my world around these truths, and now i see they were just lies. i feel like there's no floor under me anymore. just this huge, empty void where everything used to be. it's hard to even see the point in waking up tomorrow if nothing actually matters.",
